## NAO Robot Custom Pronunciation Dictionary
## Format: WORD  PHONEME SEQUENCE
## Multiple pronunciations: WORD(2)  ALTERNATE_PHONEMES
## CMU Pronouncing Dictionary phoneme set

## Trigger phrase - CRITICAL
SIMON  S AY M AH N
SIMON(2)  S IH M AH N
SAYS  S EH Z
SAYS(2)  S EY Z

## Query/Search commands
HOW  HH AW
